---
description: use this to install apps from the mac app store
globs: darwin/flake.nix
alwaysApply: false
---
to install a mac app, you first need to find the correct app id. for that, run `mas search <app name>`. after running, print the selected app name & id once more.

now add the new app at the bottom of the  `homebrew.masApps` section in `flake.nix`, afterwards prompt to run the `darwin-rebuild switch` command to run sync